# Pins the runner image act uses for `ubuntu-latest` (matching
# .github/workflows/ci.yml's own `runs-on: ubuntu-latest`) and the
# container architecture, since this repo's CI images are amd64 and this
# machine may be Apple Silicon -- act warns and can misbehave without this
# pin. See bin/ci-local.sh for the real, working invocation; running bare
# `act` still picks these flags up automatically (act reads .actrc from the
# current directory), this file alone does not fix Docker-context selection.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
--container-architecture linux/amd64
